                  <nc xml:id="m-84acb7ff-74e3-4691-b04d-10c8c570dc60" pname="f" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-f1822072-b0cd-46b8-bf32-c1a20e15706a" facs="#m-a53a3dbb-11bf-4574-a48e-902899d72e62" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-19d5bb28-8f09-4751-bfd9-c2c4eea22f81"><lg xml:id="m-55befb91-ef5d-4f71-921c-d0a4d2b7b975"><l xml:id="m-2682c9cc-e404-4b0e-9c50-d384057b0737" facs="#m-5a80476a-5145-4cbc-94a1-0ae0fd49ab56" label="text-like">Proper feasts of U. S. A.</l><l xml:id="m-b804c2e7-f39b-43b5-b1af-cb0a69943e7a" facs="#m-8fbf823f-9ba9-4951-bc0a-8f15b35de068" label="ambiguous">(72)</l><l xml:id="m-a3bf31b0-aaa8-4802-9613-da397a7941c9" facs="#m-95472d5a-a8a1-43ad-8bd1-bcb41651dd9b" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Apocalypsis beati Joannis Apostoli.</l><l xml:id="m-53118842-b00a-4a06-aaa8-68206d2d2be1" facs="#m-908ed8f7-0b03-4bb8-a8af-15d6f482122d" label="text-like">Apoc. 12, 1, 5, 14 and 15-16.</l><l xml:id="m-cfb37466-d303-4dc4-8ab4-e721a9a360a8" facs="#m-0e026098-6510-4c63-bd22-9b0dfd8e50d6" label="lyrics-like">NIgnum magnum appáruit in lieri alae duae áquilae magnae ut</l><l xml:id="m-d25a2f38-dc98-41d6-a0f5-943ad8b15fe2" facs="#m-dc18c627-d5c8-4c40-9775-9c98fdd5cfc0" label="lyrics-like">voláret in desértum in locum</l><l xml:id="m-8057a874-2e1e-48eb-9a69-f3a3127cf4bb" facs="#m-912c2708-7006-4a6e-8f05-c5f6a0866365" label="lyrics-like">D caelo: Múlier amicta sole, et</l><l xml:id="m-bd45b1f6-01fb-4ec6-a006-e8e281644fce" facs="#m-fdc0f662-b1e3-4f55-a222-2f97eb51b570" label="ambiguous">suum. Et misit serpens ex ore</l><l xml:id="m-522ff897-f97b-44dd-8b3c-f0153747716d" facs="#m-59e6f398-7163-4092-945b-d5743e973549" label="lyrics-like">luna sub pédibus ejus, et in</l><l xml:id="m-564376dc-27e5-4303-996e-027f96d7e9df" facs="#m-ccc40d04-bdfd-4a9d-bdc8-065de60e5ed8" label="ambiguous">suo post mulierem, aquam tam¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b63802b-0a9a-4f32-a778-e7a0fb211e4a" facs="#m-9d5ee30f-35e3-44d2-a9a9-7ba9d0ed0980" label="lyrics-like">cápite ejus coróna stellárum</l><l xml:id="m-461c75ad-60ab-4f70-a2c1-3d0d87772642" facs="#m-3b9bab64-788f-4d2e-a8c8-7ba0ede8cd7b" label="lyrics-like">duódecim. Et péperit filium má¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ceb53e8-0212-44e3-92dd-d8b463b884a3" facs="#m-b7a960ac-8900-40de-b59a-d5d32cfeff51" label="lyrics-like">quam flumen, ut eam fáceret</l><l xml:id="m-4ddd5c8d-6c66-49d0-b7b7-cdc87cb97df6" facs="#m-e0dee4c4-3c03-43bd-991a-6752ede22b31" label="lyrics-like">trahi a flúmine. Et adjúvit terra</l><l xml:id="m-9170642f-bb93-4325-b5cf-323f8e84c7df" facs="#m-455e760d-94de-4bb5-8b94-8ab755e76e21" label="lyrics-like">sculum, qui rectũrus erat omnes</l><l xml:id="m-f9591780-3f46-47a9-9fb5-20ff70d15271" facs="#m-1c43a0a3-65c1-44c0-afe0-f740f08ff8ff" label="lyrics-like">gentes in virga férrea: et raptus</l><l xml:id="m-7a7525ef-261d-4c86-a6af-01ba4e1f1270" facs="#m-881d0218-389e-41d7-a4be-8569ddc9a96e" label="lyrics-like">mulierem, et apéruit terra os</l><l xml:id="m-060c2371-d59f-4f5c-9297-908a63f06cf3" facs="#m-86720287-70bd-42f4-a46e-6f00e3a2efe0" label="ambiguous">est filius ejus ad Deum, et ad</l><l xml:id="m-9e082d05-72b3-4b8e-801d-c0ad901e8547" facs="#m-46d8f3de-ec55-4f71-b11b-5adccd2b95fb" label="lyrics-like">suum, et absórbuit flumen, quod</l><l xml:id="m-ab33a696-9f5b-446c-a1db-d58c41b4efee" facs="#m-0fe6a851-62f4-45ef-9ffa-7369edf61e48" label="ambiguous">thronum ejus. Et datae sunt mu- misit draco de ore suo.</l><l xml:id="m-d017daff-94d1-47b8-9f31-ca28c1927da2" facs="#m-409cbc29-3415-4688-813f-fb5c9872d139" label="ambiguous">Grad.2</l><l xml:id="m-ad9c4c37-a233-4339-93c4-ec5c4dcc35b6" facs="#m-eab96c75-6f75-4f0d-9777-affac57b4c8e" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-afa362d3-816e-408a-842b-96f4c4780169" facs="#m-6cf0b15b-f14e-4177-854b-8920517e1a0e" label="lyrics-like">Il Ementó-te</l><l xml:id="m-6142b336-daf7-4904-b965-ca04f2ffb5e5" facs="#m-64f4c473-f722-4df4-b9fc-eabedc2540c8" label="lyrics-like">mi-ra-bí¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0df7cec-f083-4cc4-9690-97b0981dfffd" facs="#m-0ac056e2-bece-4af1-a728-cea702257691" label="ambiguous">li¬ um</l><l xml:id="m-db9d2e54-1bff-4ba9-9dea-c38174ca37fa" facs="#m-705e34d7-26b4-41c7-ad3f-b18aa2776497" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b3ee2b0-76c9-41ed-a203-fca2c93d914e" facs="#m-ab56468b-a178-464a-a327-f09cbcbd6767" label="lyrics-like">prodí gi¬a</l><l xml:id="m-125b6fed-bc4d-416b-b754-b30ea25043bf" facs="#m-6e9a93a7-0977-44c2-8d97-96997a812dde" label="lyrics-like">jus, quae fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1322fe50-93b0-411c-9248-bf3b06332989" facs="#m-30484270-b237-4380-a4b9-1c29d6a56657" label="ambiguous">cit:</l><l xml:id="m-be96ead8-393d-4fc0-b7be-15d2bba30ad8" facs="#m-28ede013-d396-4a94-a261-1d020d31751c" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-98df2380-8097-471c-8946-f1f7959192b9" facs="#m-646af098-55ec-4f82-a9e1-986d9b74773c" label="lyrics-like">et judí-ci-a 6- ris é-jus.</l><l xml:id="m-c55e81e6-27f7-4582-89c8-e1a78ec92519" facs="#m-4f800b25-a8dd-4d3e-8541-fd024a4f5d88" label="ambiguous">jus,</l><l xml:id="m-3f65f145-26dd-407e-bb8b-fbf621456e28" facs="#m-102ddaea-30ad-455d-a403-a6334194b6a9" label="lyrics-like">V. Pósu¬it</l><l xml:id="m-0dca9fef-4d4d-4fbf-87bd-b25648fed438" facs="#m-afd43728-0033-43bc-b365-5be5196c7660" label="lyrics-like">in é¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-9a6168e9-4fc1-421b-8acb-26b96af3a6a8" facs="#m-5753845f-8ad0-450c-a649-c31627410c2f" label="lyrics-like">vér- ba signó¬ rum su-órum,</l><l xml:id="m-bee4474f-e495-4ff3-9d19-615dac287875" facs="#m-6a932813-d552-4ee8-a1ac-e50e51192a99" label="lyrics-like">et prodigi-ó- rum su-6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a57ed38-c83e-406d-9d4d-6a457ff1b059" facs="#m-40b3e8d5-8c04-415e-9fe2-bc0c4c57da79" label="ambiguous">rum</l><l xml:id="m-8b17e264-0213-474a-937e-b5d9d5778420" facs="#m-bb0eb82a-4dab-461e-8d14-917b84d93f30" label="lyrics-like">in tér-ra.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
